{"minVersion":"0.1","headerImage":"https://qnblackcat.github.io/repo/assets/com.qn.zalozen_iphoneos-arm64/banner.png","tintColor":"","tabs":[{"tabname":"Details","views":[{"class":"DepictionScreenshotsView","screenshots":[{"url":"https://qnblackcat.github.io/repo/assets/com.qn.zalozen_iphoneos-arm64/screenshot/1.jpg","accessibilityText":"Screenshot"},{"url":"https://qnblackcat.github.io/repo/assets/com.qn.zalozen_iphoneos-arm64/screenshot/2.jpg","accessibilityText":"Screenshot"}],"itemCornerRadius":8,"itemSize":"{185,400}"},{"markdown":"Tweak cho Zalo iOS, gi\u00fap Zalo g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng h\u01a1n. Vui l\u00f2ng b\u1eadt tweak trong C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t sau khi c\u00e0i.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f L\u01b0u \u00fd: T\u00e1c gi\u1ea3 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m cho b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 n\u00e0o ph\u00e1t sinh v\u1edbi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ZaloZen.\n\nT\u00ednh n\u0103ng:\n- **Th\u00eam emoji:** n\u00fat `+` tr\u00ean thanh reaction m\u1edf b\u1ea3ng ch\u1ecdn emoji \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 (c\u00f3 Y\u00eau th\u00edch v\u00e0 G\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e2y).\n- **\u1ea8n Media Box, Business Box...:** \u1ea9n Media Box, Business Box, zCloud, zBusiness kh\u1ecfi danh s\u00e1ch chat.\n- **\u1ea8n th\u00f4ng tin:** \u1ea8n Avatar, t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi g\u1eedi, tin nh\u1eafn g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t trong danh s\u00e1ch chat.\n- **Ri\u00eang t\u01b0:** \u1ea8n tr\u1ea1ng th\u00e1i \u0111ang so\u1ea1n tin, \u0111\u00e3 xem, \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1eadn.\n","useSpacing":"true","class":"DepictionMarkdownView"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionHeaderView","title":"Information"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Developer","text":"Qn"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Version","text":"1.0.0"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Compatibility","text":"iOS 15.0 or later"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Section","text":"Tweaks"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"Depic